{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Homeworld: Vast Reaches, you play as Fleet Command, controlling your ships in vicious real-time combat against a mysterious new enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the VR experience in a dramatic single-player campaign and in three new challenge levels, as you direct your fleet to attack, defend, or capture strategic resources to build up your arsenal of ships and achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/extras/62c3dab41251ce007e2bf82ad6ea9159.poster.avif?t=1761157490\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/extras/62c3dab41251ce007e2bf82ad6ea9159.webm?t=1761157490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/extras/62c3dab41251ce007e2bf82ad6ea9159.mp4?t=1761157490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MADE FOR VIRTUAL REALITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fleet is now at your fingertips as you can execute strategic attacks on your enemies from any direction or angle. Get up close and personal to epic space battles, commanding your ships in real-time all around you as this new VR perspective allows you to build units, shape fleet formations, and orchestrate combat tactics while you're in the middle of the action<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/extras/9190229dc06a0b9d4cfaf3d18835bac1.poster.avif?t=1761157490\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/extras/9190229dc06a0b9d4cfaf3d18835bac1.webm?t=1761157490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/extras/9190229dc06a0b9d4cfaf3d18835bac1.mp4?t=1761157490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAKE ON NEW CHALLENGE LEVELS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with the hardcore player in mind - these new challenges are the ultimate test of skill and tactics.  These three challenges each have multiple difficulty levels, providing hours of gameplay and a chance to prove yourself as the best commander in the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/extras/08f435c2bf347f0f7ec07c7ccf6b6cfb.poster.avif?t=1761157490\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/extras/08f435c2bf347f0f7ec07c7ccf6b6cfb.webm?t=1761157490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/extras/08f435c2bf347f0f7ec07c7ccf6b6cfb.mp4?t=1761157490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A BOLD NEW STORY IN THE BELOVED HOMEWORLD SAGA\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set between the events of Homeworld 1 and Homeworld 2, you take on the role of Tyrra Soban, a new Fleet Command. Guiding you is Karan S\u2019jet, the legendary hero of Homeworld War, as the original Kushan Mothership is pulled from retirement to serve as the flagship of a new fleet. Together, Tyrra and Karan face a new threat, the Radaa, duplicitous interstellar traders who want to obtain your hyperspace core and don\u2019t care if they destroy your Homeworld to get it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2949240?t=1761157490","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/527db606de7494636a18ab63c30546c4c946be8e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761157490","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/0db150a740f49864854eb34c2f28c74bce1e1776/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761157490","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/0db150a740f49864854eb34c2f28c74bce1e1776/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761157490","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Homeworld: Vast Reaches, you play as Fleet Command, controlling your ships in vicious real-time combat against a mysterious new enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the VR experience in a dramatic single-player campaign and in three new challenge levels, as you direct your fleet to attack, defend, or capture strategic resources to build up your arsenal of ships and achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/extras/62c3dab41251ce007e2bf82ad6ea9159.poster.avif?t=1761157490\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/extras/62c3dab41251ce007e2bf82ad6ea9159.webm?t=1761157490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/extras/62c3dab41251ce007e2bf82ad6ea9159.mp4?t=1761157490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MADE FOR VIRTUAL REALITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fleet is now at your fingertips as you can execute strategic attacks on your enemies from any direction or angle. Get up close and personal to epic space battles, commanding your ships in real-time all around you as this new VR perspective allows you to build units, shape fleet formations, and orchestrate combat tactics while you're in the middle of the action<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/extras/9190229dc06a0b9d4cfaf3d18835bac1.poster.avif?t=1761157490\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/extras/9190229dc06a0b9d4cfaf3d18835bac1.webm?t=1761157490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/extras/9190229dc06a0b9d4cfaf3d18835bac1.mp4?t=1761157490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAKE ON NEW CHALLENGE LEVELS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with the hardcore player in mind - these new challenges are the ultimate test of skill and tactics.  These three challenges each have multiple difficulty levels, providing hours of gameplay and a chance to prove yourself as the best commander in the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/extras/08f435c2bf347f0f7ec07c7ccf6b6cfb.poster.avif?t=1761157490\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/extras/08f435c2bf347f0f7ec07c7ccf6b6cfb.webm?t=1761157490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/extras/08f435c2bf347f0f7ec07c7ccf6b6cfb.mp4?t=1761157490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A BOLD NEW STORY IN THE BELOVED HOMEWORLD SAGA\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set between the events of Homeworld 1 and Homeworld 2, you take on the role of Tyrra Soban, a new Fleet Command. Guiding you is Karan S\u2019jet, the legendary hero of Homeworld War, as the original Kushan Mothership is pulled from retirement to serve as the flagship of a new fleet. Together, Tyrra and Karan face a new threat, the Radaa, duplicitous interstellar traders who want to obtain your hyperspace core and don\u2019t care if they destroy your Homeworld to get it.</p>","developers":["FarBridge"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949240/9d494537fb089e60ecc4e9eeeca78c37a1a1d688/header.jpg?t=1761157490","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 FarBridge, Inc. Developed and published by FarBridge, Inc. Homeworld and related marks are trademarks of Gearbox Software, LLC. 2K and the 2K logo are trademarks of Take-Two Interactive Software, Inc. Steam and the Steam logo are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of Valve Corporation. Meta Quest and the Meta logo are trademarks of Meta Platforms, Inc. All other marks and trademarks are the property of their respective owners. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2949240/1113374773/c9c8003cb9f96fae9b22d5e6c2b946a4e0e17202/1759496738/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759497673","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2949240/1113374773/c9c8003cb9f96fae9b22d5e6c2b946a4e0e17202/1759496738/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759497673","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https